        rdfs:comment                   "Textile of brocaded silk, Spitalfields, London, 1733-1734"@en , "Textile of brocaded silk in colours. Tissue with a tabby ground. The design is bound in 3/1 twill. Only the white and green areas are produced by pattern wefts and the other colours are brocaded. Foliage design."@en ;
